            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you so much for sharing your feedback! We’re glad to hear you had a great stay overall and loved the location. We really appreciate your patience with the items that needed attention, and we’re happy our team was able to get on top of things quickly for you. Your notes are super helpful, and we’ll make sure they’re addressed. We’d love to welcome you back again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was more than satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nOverall we had a great experience with this rental property. There were several things not working quite right, but the property management company was very responsive in trying to get them addressed. Great communication before, during, and after the rental period. Some items that had to be addressed were the rain shower head in master bathroom was busted and unusable, the lighter for the fire pit was non-functional and needed a new battery, and the microwave in the cottage house had issues. The short walk to the beach was very convenient as we didn't have to cross the main road. It was also away from most of the heavy traffic areas of Rosemary beack, but still walkable.",
